WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.917 --> 00:00:03.712
The character of Ernest Burkhart, I found

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:05.046
absolutely fascinating.

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.757
Ernest comes to Oklahoma

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:09.884
and ultimately falls in love with Mollie Kyle.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.177
Sho-mee-kah-see.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.512
I don’t know what you said

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.681
but it must have been Indian for handsome devil.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.974
[LAUGHS]

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.935
William K. Hale uses that as an opportunity

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.895
to prey upon her wealth. 

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.815
The Osage, they gonna go!

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:24.774
Their time is over.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.986
Ernest is under a very strong influence of his uncle.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.321
He finds himself getting deeper into

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.322
murderous plans.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.992
I’m sorry, for all the troubles.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:38.204
Working with Leo and watching this master

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.789
create this character,

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:41.750
it’s unbelievable.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.670
Ernest’s the real life representation

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.381
of the incredible greed of that time. 

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.549
I just love money!

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.136
I love it as much as I love my wife.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.054
[LAUGHS]

